{"version":1,"content":"<p>今午（18日）2時許，警方接獲報案，指一對男女於屯門山景邨景榮樓一單位燒炭。</p><p>涉事男女年約70歲，被發現時已陷昏迷，接報到場救護員即場為兩人進行檢查及急救，再由救護車送往屯門醫院搶救。</p><p>事件起因仍有待警方調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:18:57.657346+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:51:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:57:32.387941+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:33.607573+00:00","content_hash":"bac23a2f25bae2d86ae12a1f5fbb6ccf6bee6079e9fadb20d790fe6a82c01d23","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}